-			MQ_NAME(prefers_reduced_transparency) ||
+	/*
+	 * Reduced motion is asked for (VitaSurf). An animation the page
+	 * runs costs the Vita most of its frame: Home Assistant's login
+	 * page draws a particle field on a canvas every frame unless the
+	 * browser says otherwise, and the page ran at 25 fps for it.
